Commerce Commits $5 Million to Provide Free POS and Smart Terminals to 10,000 Businesses Across US, Puerto Rico, and Guam
&nbsp;

DALLAS, TX / ACCESS Newswire / October 24, 2025 / Commerce Inc. a leader in business technology and agentic commerce solutions, today announced the official launch of Commerce360, a new merchant velocity platform engineered in partnership with GoDaddy and Worldpay. The platform is designed to provide businesses with a complete, 360-degree view of their operations-fro
